    "A current device location is needed for a walking preview. The straight-line estimate remains available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "徒歩ルートの確認には現在地が必要です。直線距離の目安は引き続き確認できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A current location is needed for walking detours. Showing straight-line distance and bearing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "徒歩での寄り道を調べるには現在地が必要です。直線距離と方角を表示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A missing-place suggestion cannot include an existing place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未掲載の場所を提案する場合、既存の場所は選べません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A nearby result does not by itself confirm that smoking is legal at that moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近くに表示されたことだけでは、その時点で喫煙が認められていることを保証しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A place missing from the map": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地図にない場所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A previous delivery could not be resolved after the app restarted. This saved draft cannot be submitted again; discard it when you are ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリの再起動後、前回の送信結果を確認できませんでした。この保存済み下書きは再送信できません。確認後に破棄してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A saved draft stays on this device until it is submitted or discarded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下書きは送信または破棄するまで、このデバイスに保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %lld min added walking time": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "徒歩で約%lld分の寄り道"
